    <li data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400"><b>PSO 01:</b> Graduates willdeeply understand and apply core principles in computer science, including algorithms, data structures, software engineering, database management, networking, and computer architecture.</li>
    <li data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="500"><b>PSO 02:</b> Graduates willemploy analytical and critical thinking skills to tackle complex computational problems in real-world scenarios, utilizing suitable algorithms, data structures, and computational techniques.</li>
    <li data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="600"><b>PSO 03:</b> Graduates will demonstrate proficiency in programming languages, software development tools, and relevant technologies, enabling them to build robust and scalable computer applications and solutions.</li>
